  notes: >-
    Runs open LLMs locally. Article frames running classification through
    Ollama as more than a cost choice: it keeps unreviewed community material
    on the team's own machine instead of shipping it to a third-party API —
    the same public/private boundary the Toolkit's infrastructure layer asks
    teams to respect for high-risk or sensitive material.
